.TH TOASTSAVER 1 "October 2026" "toastsaver 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toastsaver \- retro screensavers for Wayland desktops
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B toastsaver
.RI [ SAVER ]
.br
.B toastsaver-picker
.br
.B toastsaver-settings
.br
.B toastsaver-idle
.RB [ \-\-now
.RI [ SAVER ]
|
.B \-\-check
|
.B \-\-restart
|
.BR \-\-stop ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B toastsaver
is a collection of screensavers: flying toasters, a rainbow waffle cat, 3D pipes,
a cozy bookshelf, an aquarium, birds in a summer sky, a starfield, mystify,
matrix rain, a lava lamp and a bouncing name banner.
All artwork is drawn by the program.
.PP
At login,
.B toastsaver-idle
is started from
.IR /etc/xdg/autostart .
It runs
.BR swayidle (1),
starts the chosen saver after a period without input, stops it on any input,
and later turns the display off with
.BR wlopm (1)
if it is installed.
.PP
.B toastsaver-picker
opens a fullscreen picker with big tiles, designed for children.
Its SURPRISE ME button sets the saver to
.BR random ;
while it is on, tapping a tile puts that saver in or out of the surprise mix.
.B toastsaver-settings
opens a settings window for on/off, timings and the clock.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-windowed
Use a window instead of fullscreen.
.TP
.B \-\-list
List saver names.
.TP
.BI \-\-set " KEY=VALUE"
Change a setting and save it.
.TP
.B \-\-desktop\-icon
Put a Screensavers icon on the desktop.
.TP
.BI \-\-snapshot " FILE.png"
Render a frame to a PNG file without a display (with
.BI \-\-size " WxH"
and
.BI \-\-seconds " N"
).
.SH SAVERS
toasters, rainbow, pipes, books, aquarium, birds, starfield, mystify, matrix, lava,
name, and random.
.B random
picks a different saver each time, only from those listed in RANDOM_SAVERS
(every saver when it is empty), and not the same one twice in a row.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/toastsaver.conf
Settings, in shell syntax: ENABLED, SAVER, NAME, IDLE_MINUTES,
SCREEN_OFF_MINUTES, CLOCK, CLOCK_24H and RANDOM_SAVERS (a comma-separated
list of savers for SAVER=random; empty means all, unknown names are ignored).
Created on first change.
.SH NOTES
Needs a Wayland compositor that supports idle notification, such as labwc,
Wayfire, sway or Hyprland. It is not a lock screen.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swayidle (1),
.BR wlopm (1)
.PP
https://github.com/piyh/toastsaver
